    "title": "No foul play suspected after body found at abandoned house in Pearl River community - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Duncan Dent ,\n22 hours ago Authorities are working to identify the body of a man found Thursday afternoon on the porch of an abandoned house off BIA Road 0022 near New Black Jack Baptist Church. A concerned citizen reported the body at about 12:45 p.m. at the house less than a mile northeast of Geyser Falls Water Theme Park near what is known as Oswald Road in the Pearl River community. Read full article",
